{"c":[{"id":"819660f9289867d7","sum":"Windows: AGENTS.md clone-portable (no C:\\ argv0; not pasteable). Usage/Run may print host invoke. note/nap crash on import fcntl; pathlib --path and python .summem/summem work; no store lock file. No consumer .gitattributes; canonicalize CRLF on read; punt this-repo git symlink.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260910T005128Z-e234bb60ff9049ba","text":"Windows: AGENTS.md stays clone-portable (no C:\\ argv0); Usage/Run: may print host invoke. note/nap crash on import fcntl; pathlib --path and python .summem/summem work; do not flock a store lock file.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260910T010940Z-0a0daf8323fd00b0","text":"Windows port: no consumer .gitattributes — canonicalize CRLF on read for digest/JSON; punt this-repo git symlink; AGENTS.md is not a pasteable argv0.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"597efaa40d5ae61b","sum":"Windows: do not advertise native support (no argv0 runs in both cmd.exe and Unix shells); internals (lock, CRLF) let a Windows shop patch its bootstrap. Usage/Run: print the host invoke (sys.executable); stock AGENTS.md stays Unix.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260910T011527Z-a89670306f0346b1","text":"Do not advertise native Windows: no argv0 is a command in both cmd.exe and a Unix shell. Ceiling is internals (lock, CRLF) so a Windows-only shop can patch their bootstrap.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260910T011559Z-5a487f135c8e6892","text":"Windows: print host-specific invoke on Usage/Run: (sys.executable). Stock AGENTS.md stays Unix; only a shop that patched the bootstrap will see the Windows lines.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
